<FTL>

<!--
    SC SECTOR EVENT STUBS

    Purpose:
    This file is an outline for a new SC themed sector event file.
    It follows the same broad structure used by Multiverse sector files:

    Reference patterns inspected from Multiverse 5.5.1 Data:
      * sector_data.xml.append
        SECTOR_UNION uses ENTER_UNION, FINISH_BEACON_UNION, STORELIST_UNION,
        ITEMS_UNION, NEUTRAL_UNION, DISTRESS_UNION, QUESTS_UNION, HOSTILE_UNION,
        PIRACY_LIST, and FILLER_LIST.

      * events_sector_union.xml
        Defines FINISH_BEACON_UNION first, then sectioned eventLists such as
        ITEMS_UNION, NEUTRAL_UNION, DISTRESS_UNION, QUESTS_UNION, and HOSTILE_UNION.

      * events_sector_droppoint.xml
        Defines local ship wrappers first, then exit beacon, filler, item,
        neutral, distress, quest, hostile, and unique event lists.

      * events_sector_rebel.xml and events_sector_pirate.xml
        Use the same sector list pattern with faction specific event names.

    Integration note:
    The sectorDescription itself normally belongs in sector_data.xml.append, not here.
    A suggested sectorDescription snippet is included as a comment near the end of this file.

    Blueprint note:
    The auto_blueprint values below are placeholders. Add matching lists to autoBlueprints.xml.append.
-->

