<!--
////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    GENERIC COMBAT RESULT EVENTS
////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
-->

<event name="SC_SURRENDER_TERRAN">
    <text>"Stand down. We can transfer supplies if you let us limp out of here."</text>
    <choice>
        <text>Accept their surrender.</text>
        <event>
            <ship hostile="false"/>
            <autoReward level="RANDOM">stuff</autoReward>
        </event>
    </choice>
    <choice>
        <text>Refuse.</text>
        <event/>
    </choice>
</event>

<event name="SC_SURRENDER_RAIDER">
    <text>"Fine, fine. Take the cargo. Just do not vent us into space."</text>
    <choice>
        <text>Accept the cargo.</text>
        <event>
            <ship hostile="false"/>
            <autoReward level="MED">stuff</autoReward>
        </event>
    </choice>
    <choice>
        <text>Finish the fight.</text>
        <event/>
    </choice>
</event>

<event name="SC_SURRENDER_PROTOSS">
    <text>The Protoss commander transmits a terse offer of withdrawal. Their vessel remains dangerous, but they seem willing to leave.</text>
    <choice>
        <text>Allow them to withdraw.</text>
        <event>
            <ship hostile="false"/>
            <autoReward level="LOW">standard</autoReward>
        </event>
    </choice>
    <choice>
        <text>Continue the battle.</text>
        <event/>
    </choice>
</event>

<event name="SC_SURRENDER_DOMINION_ELITE">
    <text>"You have made your point. We are authorized to offer battlefield salvage for safe passage."</text>
    <choice>
        <text>Accept the offer.</text>
        <event>
            <ship hostile="false"/>
            <autoReward level="MED">item</autoReward>
        </event>
    </choice>
    <choice>
        <text>No deal.</text>
        <event/>
    </choice>
</event>

<event name="SC_DESTROYED_TERRAN">
    <text>The Terran patrol ship breaks apart. You salvage what remains.</text>
    <autoReward level="MED">standard</autoReward>
</event>

<event name="SC_DEAD_CREW_TERRAN">
    <text>With the crew neutralized, you search the Terran vessel and secure its supplies.</text>
    <autoReward level="HIGH">standard</autoReward>
</event>

<event name="SC_DESTROYED_RAIDER">
    <text>The raider ship is destroyed. Whatever cargo survived is now yours.</text>
    <autoReward level="MED">standard</autoReward>
</event>

<event name="SC_DEAD_CREW_RAIDER">
    <text>The raiders are gone. Their hold is easy to search now.</text>
    <autoReward level="HIGH">item</autoReward>
</event>

<event name="SC_DESTROYED_ZERG">
    <text>The swarm vessel ruptures, leaving behind only scorched biological residue and a few salvageable fragments.</text>
    <autoReward level="LOW">standard</autoReward>
</event>

<event name="SC_DEAD_CREW_ZERG">
    <text>The infestation is quiet. Your crew carefully collects what can be salvaged.</text>
    <autoReward level="MED">standard</autoReward>
</event>

<event name="SC_DESTROYED_INFESTED">
    <text>The infested ship collapses in a cloud of spores. You keep your distance and recover whatever drifts clear.</text>
    <autoReward level="LOW">standard</autoReward>
</event>

<event name="SC_DEAD_CREW_INFESTED">
    <text>The last infested life-sign fades. The ship is dangerous to board, but some supplies are intact.</text>
    <autoReward level="MED">standard</autoReward>
</event>

<event name="SC_DESTROYED_PROTOSS">
    <text>The Protoss ship fractures under your fire. Its strange components are difficult to repurpose, but valuable.</text>
    <autoReward level="MED">standard</autoReward>
</event>

<event name="SC_DEAD_CREW_PROTOSS">
    <text>The Protoss vessel falls silent. You recover advanced components from the ship.</text>
    <autoReward level="HIGH">standard</autoReward>
</event>

<event name="SC_DESTROYED_DOMINION_ELITE">
    <text>The Dominion elite ship is destroyed. Its reinforced hull leaves useful salvage behind.</text>
    <autoReward level="HIGH">standard</autoReward>
</event>

<event name="SC_DEAD_CREW_DOMINION_ELITE">
    <text>With the Dominion crew defeated, you seize their equipment and encrypted supply manifest.</text>
    <autoReward level="HIGH">item</autoReward>
</event>

<!--
////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    START AND EXIT BEACONS
////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
-->

<event name="ENTER_SC_SECTOR">
    <text>You enter a sector caught between Terran militaries, raider factions, Protoss expeditions, and the ever-present threat of infestation. Sensor ghosts flicker across the map as your MV drive adjusts to the local warp signatures.</text>
    <choice hidden="true">
        <text>Continue...</text>
        <event/>
    </choice>
</event>

<event name="FINISH_BEACON_SC">
    <text id="finish_beacon"/>
    <choice hidden="true">
        <text>Explore.</text>
        <event load="EXIT_FILLER_LIST"/>
    </choice>
    <choice hidden="true">
        <text>Do something onboard the ship.</text>
        <event load="STORAGE_CHECK"/>
    </choice>
    <choice hidden="true">
        <text>Do nothing.</text>
        <event/>
    </choice>
</event>

<event name="FINISH_BEACON_SC_FLEET">
    <text>The fleet has reached the exit beacon. A heavily armed pursuit vessel blocks your path.</text>
    <ship load="SC_SHIP_DOMINION_ELITE" hostile="true"/>
    <choice hidden="true">
        <text>Continue...</text>
        <event load="COMBAT_CHECK"/>
    </choice>
</event>

